'''Brunch Rush''' (純喫茶, ''Jun Kissa'', '''Cafe''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (Sm): Cat Cannon will charge 10 seconds faster.

